{"id": 2796, "modified_gmt": "2026-11-16T17:18:07", "meta": {"_acf_changed": false, "footnotes": "", "_elementor_edit_mode": "builder", "_elementor_template_type": "wp-page", "_elementor_data": "[{\"id\": \"3ae9583\", \"elType\": \"container\", \"settings\": {\"content_width\": \"full\", \"css_classes\": \"cc-wrap\", \"padding\": {\"unit\": \"px\", \"top\": \"0\", \"right\": \"0\", \"bottom\": \"0\", \"left\": \"0\", \"isLinked\": true}, \"flex_gap\": {\"unit\": \"px\", \"size\": 0, \"column\": \"0\", \"row\": \"0\"}}, \"elements\": [{\"id\": \"7c0fbef\", \"elType\": \"widget\", \"widgetType\": \"html\", \"settings\": {\"html\": \"<div class=\\\"cl cl-page\\\"><div class=\\\"hero phero\\\">\\n  <img src=\\\"https://tours.cigalacycling.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/cigala-tours-hero-granfondo.webp\\\" alt=\\\"Maratona Dles Dolomites | The Magic start\\\">\\n  <div class=\\\"in\\\">\\n    <div class=\\\"crumbs\\\"><a href=\\\"/\\\">Home</a> / <a href=\\\"/trips/\\\">Bike tours</a> / Gran Fondo tours</div>\\n    <div class=\\\"pill-eyebrow\\\">2027 season \\u00b7 gran fondo</div>\\n    <h1>GRANFONDO BIKE TOURS</h1>\\n    <div class=\\\"bar\\\"></div>\\n    <div class=\\\"lede\\\"><p>Ride the same roads as the pros. Our Gran Fondo trips pair guaranteed race entry with a fully guided holiday, so you never have to worry about registration deadlines, transport, or logistics \\u2014 just show up and ride. Tackle Tuscany&#x27;s white gravel roads at Strade Bianche, take on the cobbles and bergs of the Tour of Flanders, or chase the final monument of the season at Il Lombardia on the shores of Lake Como.Each trip is built around the race weekend itself: ride the course, soak up the atmosphere, and then watch the world&#x27;s best professionals battle it out on the very same roads the next day. With small groups, hand-built routes, and support from former pro riders, it&#x27;s the closest thing to living the pro cycling calendar from the inside.</p></div>\\n    <p class=\\\"l