rue\\\"><path d=\\\"M2 20l6.5-10 4 6 3-4.5L22 20z\\\"/></svg>6,000 m</span><span class=\\\"chip lvl\\\"><span class=\\\"lm\\\" aria-hidden=\\\"true\\\"><i class=on></i><i></i><i></i></span>Level: Beginner, Intermediate, Expert</span><span class=\\\"chip avc\\\"><span class=\\\"avl low\\\">Last few spots</span></span></div>\\n    <div class=\\\"desc clamp\\\"><p>Everybody in cycling knows the iconic Strade Bianche. We\\u2019ve designed a unique cycling holiday based in the heart of Chianti, where you\\u2019ll ride Tuscany\\u2019s famous white roads, take part in the Gran Fondo on Sunday, and watch the pros on Saturday. With guaranteed entry, grid start options, and VIP race access, this is the ultimate Strade Bianche experience.</p></div>\\n    <button type=\\\"button\\\" class=\\\"more-txt\\\" aria-expanded=\\\"false\\\" hidden>Read more</button>\\n    <div class=\\\"bottom\\\">\\n      <div class=\\\"price\\\"><small>From</small>\\u20ac1349 | \\u00a31149 | $1549*</div>\\n      <span class=\\\"early none\\\" aria-hidden=\\\"true\\\">&nbsp;</span>\\n      <div class=\\\"ctas\\\"><a class=\\\"btn btn-ghost\\\" href=\\\"/trips/chianti-gran-fondo-strade-bianche/\\\">More details</a><a class=\\\"btn btn-go\\\" href=\\\"https://cigalacyclingtours.wetravel.com/checkout_embed?uuid=8896226693&source=direct_link\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" rel=\\\"noopener\\\">Book now \\u2192</a></div>\\n    </div>\\n  </div>\\n</article>\\n<article class=\\\"tcard\\\" data-k=\\\"gf\\\" data-level=\\\"beginner\\\">\\n  <a class=\\\"ph\\\" href=\\\"/trips/tour-of-flanders-experience/\\\"><img src=\\\"https://tours.cigalacycling.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/cigala-tours-trip-tour-of-flanders-experience.webp\\\" alt=\\\"Tour of Flanders Experience Tour\\\" loading=\\\"lazy\\\" width=\\\"1200\\\" height=\\\"900\\\"><span class=\\\"tags\\\"><span class=\\\"tag\\\">Road</span><span class=\\\"tag\\\">Gran Fondo</span></span><img class=\\\"flag\\\" src=\\\"https://tours.cigalacycling.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/cigala-tours-flag-be.webp\\\" alt=\\\"Flag of Belgium\\\" width=\\\"40\\\" height=\\\"30\\\"><span class=\\\"entry entry-support\\\"><svg viewBox=\\\"0 0 24 24\\\" aria-hidden=\\\"true\\\"><path d=\\\"M12 2 4 5v6c0 5 3.4 9.4 8 11 4.6-1.6 8-6 8-11V5l-8-3zm-1.2 14.2-3.5-3.5 1.4-1.4 2.1 2.1 4.9-4.9 1.4 1.4-6.3 6.3z\\\"/></svg>Event day fully supported</span></a>\\n  <div class=\\\"tx\\\">\\n    <h2>Tour of Flanders Experience</h2>\\n    <h3 class=\\\"where\\\">Flanders, Belgium</h3>\\n    <div class=\\\"meta\\\"><span class=\\\"chip date\\\"><time datetime=\\\"2027-04-01\\\">1\\u20135 Apr 2027</time></span><span class=\\\"chip\\\">4 nights / 5 days</span><span class=\\\"chip dist\\\"><svg viewBox=\\\"0 0 24 24\\\" aria-hidden=\\\"true\\\"><circle cx=\\\"5\\\" cy=\\\"18\\\" r=\\\"2.2\\\"/><circle cx=\\\"19\\\" cy=\\\"6\\\" r=\\\"2.2\\\"/><path d=\\\"M7 18h8.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 0 0-7h-7a3.5 3.5 0 0 1 0-7H17\\\"/></svg>120-300 km<span class=\\\"sep\\\" aria-hidden=\\\"true\\\"></span><svg viewBox=\\\"0 0 24 24\\\" aria-hidden=\\\"true\\\"><path d=\\\"M2 20l6.5-10 4 6 3-4.5L22 20z\\\"/></svg>1,000-3,000 m</span><span class=\\\"chip lvl\\\"><span class=\\\"lm\\\" aria-hidden=\\\"true\\\"><i class=on></i><i></i><i></i></span>Level: Beginner, Intermediate, Expert</span><span class=\\\"chip avc\\\"><span class=\\\"avl mid\\\">Filling up fast</span></span></div>\\n    <div class=\\\"desc clamp\\\"><p>Ride it. Watch it. Live it.</p><p>Take on the cobbles of the Tour of Flanders weekend in the ultimate cycling experience.</p><p>Ride the legendary climbs in the We Ride Flanders sportive, then watch the world\\u2019s best battle it out on the same roads the very next day with premium race access.From brutal cobbles to electric crowds, this is Flanders at its best.</p></div>\\n    <button type=\\\"button\\\" class=\\\"more-txt\\\" aria-expanded=\\\"false\\\" hidden>Read more</button>\\n    <div class=\\\"bottom\\\">\\n      <div class=\\\"price\\\"><small>Price</small>\\u20ac1299 | \\u00a31149 | $1549*</div>\\n      <span class=\\\"early\\\">Early bird price until 30/11</span>\\n      <div class=\\\"ctas\\\"><a class=\\\"btn btn-ghost\\\" href=\\\"/trips/tour-of-flanders-experience/\\\">More details</a><a class=\\\"btn btn-go\\\" href=\\\"https://cigalacyclingtours.wetravel.com/checkout_embed?uuid=8767371711&source=direct_link\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" rel=\\\"noopener\\\">Book now \\u2192</a></div>\\n    </div>\\n  </div>\\n</article>\\n<article class=\\\"tcard\\\" data-k=\\\"gf\\\" data-level=\\\"beginner\\\">\\n  <a class=\\\"ph\\\" href=\\\"/trips/maratona-dles-dolomites/\\\"><img src=\\\"https://tours.cigalacycling.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/cigala-tours-trip-maratona-dles-dolomites.webp\\\" alt=\\\"Maratona Dles Dolomites Bike Tour\\\" loading=\\\"lazy\\\" width=\\\"1200\\\" height=\\\"900\\\"><span class=\\\"tags\\\"><span class=\\\"tag\\\">Road</span><span class=\\\"tag\\\">Gran Fondo</span></span><img class=\\\"flag\\\" src=\\\"https://tours.cigalacycling.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/cigala-tours-flag-it.webp\\\" alt=\\\"Flag of Italy\\\" width=\\\"40\\\" height=\\\"30\\\"><span class=\\\"entry\\\"><svg viewBox=\\\"0 0 24 24\\\" aria-hidden=\\\"true\\\"><path d=\\\"M7 3h10v2h4v3a5 5 0 0 1-4.6 5A5 5 0 0 1 13 15.9V19h4v2H7v-2h4v-3.1A5 5 0 0 1 7.6 13 5 5 0 0 1 3 8V5h4V3zm0 4H5v1a3 3 0 0 0 2 2.8V7zm10 0v3.8A3 3 0 0 0 19 8V7h-2z\\\"/></svg>Event entry guaranteed</span></a>\\n  <div class=\\\"tx\\\">\\n    <h2>Maratona dles Dolomites - Enel</h2>\\n    <h3 class=\\\"where\\\">Alta Badia, Italy</h3>\\n    <div class=\\\"meta\\\"><span class=\\\"chip date\\\"><time datetime=\\\"2027-06-30\\\">30 Jun \\u2013 5 Jul 2027</time></span><span class=\\\"chip\\\">5 nights/ 6 days</span><span class=\\\"chip dist\\\"><svg viewBox=\\\"0 0 24 24\\\" aria-hidden=\\\"true\\\"><circle cx=\\\"5\\\" cy=\\\"18\\\" r=\\\"2.2\\\"/><circle cx=\\\"19\\\" cy=\\\"6\\\" r=\\\"2.2\\\"/><path d=\\\"M7 18h8.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 0 0-7h-7a3.5 3.5 0 0 1 0-7H17\\\"/></svg>250-350 km<span class=\\\"sep\\\" aria-hidden=\\\"true\\\"></span><svg viewBox=\\\"0 0 24 24\\\" aria-hidden=\\\"true\\\"><path d=\\\"M2 20l6.5-10 4 6 3-4.5L22 20z\\\"/></svg>5,000-7,000 m</span><span class=\\\"chip lvl\\\"><span class=\\\"lm\\\" aria-hidden=\\\"true\\\"><i class=on></i><i></i><i></i></span>Level: Beginner, Intermediate, Expert</span><span class=\\\"chip avc\\\"><span class=\\\"avl mid\\\">Filling up fast</span></span></div>\\n    <div class=\\\"desc clamp\\\"><p>Join Cigala Cycling Tours, an Official Tour Operator of the Maratona dles Dolomites \\u2013 Enel, for the 40th edition on 4 July 2027.</p><p>Ride through the spectacular Dolomites, taking on iconic climbs including the Campolongo, Pordoi, Sella, Gardena, Giau and Falzarego, with premium accommodation and full support from our experienced team.</p></div>\\n    <button type=\\\"button\\\" class=\\\"more-txt\\\" aria-expanded=\\\"false\\\" hidden>Read more</button>\\n    <div class=\\\"bottom\\\">\\n      <div class=\\\"price\\\"><small>From</small>\\u20ac2249 | \\u00a31959 | $2599*</div>\\n      <span class=\\\"early\\\">Early bird price until 31/01</span>\\n      <div class=\\\"ctas\\\"><a class=\\\"btn btn-ghost\\\" href=\\\"/trips/maratona-dles-dolomites/\\\">More details</a><a class=\\\"btn btn-go\\\" href=\\\"https://cigalacyclingtours.wetravel.com/checkout_embed?uuid=4934180003&source=direct_link\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" rel=\\\"noopener\\\">Book now \\u2192</a></div>\\n    </div>\\n  </div>\\n</article>\\n<article class=\\\"tcard\\\" data-k=\\\"gf\\\" data-level=\\\"beginner\\\">\\n  <a class=\\\"ph\\\" href=\\\"/trips/lake-como-gran-fondo-il-lombardia/\\\"><img src=\\\"https://tours.cigalacycling.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/cigala-tours-trip-lake-como-gran-fondo-il-lombardia.webp\\\" alt=\\\"Lake Como &amp; Lombardia 2027\\\" loading=\\\"lazy\\\" width=\\\"1200\\\" height=\\\"900\\\"><span class=\\\"tags\\\"><span class=\\\"tag\\\">Road</span><span class=\\\"tag\\\">Gran Fondo</span></span><img class=\\\"flag\\\" src=\\\"https://tours.cigalacycling.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/cigala-tours-flag-it.webp\\\" alt=\\\"Flag of Italy\\\" width=\\\"40\\\" height=\\\"30\\\"><span class=\\\"entry\\\"><svg viewBox=\\\"0 0 24 24\\\" aria-hidden=\\\"true\\\"><path d=\\\"M7 3h10v2h4v3a5 5 0 0 1-4.6 5A5 5 0 0 1 13 15.9V19h4v2H7v-2h4v-3.1A5 5 0 0 1 7.6 13 5 5 0 0 1 3 8V5h4V3zm0 4H5v1a3 3 0 0 0 2 2.8V7zm10 0v3.8A3 3 0 0 0 19 8V7h-2z\\\"/></svg>Event entry guaranteed</span></a>\\n  <div class=\\\"tx\\\">\\n    <h2>Lake Como, Gran Fondo Il Lombardia &amp; Pro Race</h2>\\n    <h3 class=\\\"where\\\">Lake Como, Italy</h3>\\n    <div class=\\\"meta\\\"><span class=\\\"chip date\\\"><time datetime=\\\"2027-10-06\\\">6\\u201311 Oct 2027</time></span><span class=\\\"chip\\\">5 nights/6 days</span><span class=\\\"chip dist\\\"><svg viewBox=\\\"0 0 24 24\\\" aria-hidden=\\\"true\\\"><circle cx=\\\"5\\\" cy=\\\"18\\\" r=\\\"2.2\\\"/><circle cx=\\\"19\\\" cy=\\\"6\\\" r=\\\"2.2\\\"/><path d=\\\"M7 18h8.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 0 0-7h-7a3.5 3.5 0 0 1 0-7H17\\\"/></svg>410 km<span class=\\\"sep\\\" aria-hidden=\\\"true\\\"></span><svg viewBox=\\\"0 0 24 24\\\" aria-hidden=\\\"true\\\"><path d=\\\"M2 20l6.5-10 4 6 3-4.5L22 20z\\\"/></svg>5,300 m</span><span class=\\\"chip lvl\\\"><span class=\\\"lm\\\" aria-hidden=\\\"true\\\"><i class=on></i><i></i><i></i></span>Level: Beginner, Intermediate, Expert</span></div>\\n    <div class=\\\"desc clamp\\\"><p>Everybody that is into cycling knows the last monument of the year, \\\"Il Lombardia\\\".</p><p>We designed a unique Cycling Holiday basing us on a central location for you to discover the beauty of Lake Como, watch the pros and ride the Gran Fondo \\\"Il Lombardia\\\".</p><p>From iconic climbs to lakeside roads, this is the ultimate way to experience Il Lombardia from the inside.</p></div>\\n    <button type=\\\"button\\\" class=\\\"more-txt\\\" aria-expanded=\\\"false\\\" hidden>Read more</button>\\n    <div class=\\\"bottom\\\">\\n      <div class=\\\"price\\\"><small>Price</small>\\u20ac1299 | \\u00a31149 | $1499*</div>\\n      <span class=\\\"early\\\">Early bird price until 30/05</span>\\n      <div class=\\\"ctas\\\"><a class=\\\"btn btn-ghost\\\" href=\\\"/trips/lake-como-gran-fondo-il-lombardia/\\\">More details</a><a class=\\\"btn btn-go\\\" href=\\\"https://cigalacyclingtours.wetravel.com/checkout_embed?uuid=1699558775&source=direct_link\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" rel=\\\"noopener\\\">Book now \\u2192</a></div>\\n    </div>\\n  </div>\\n</article>\\n    </div><p class=\\\"lvnone\\\" hidden>No tour here for this level yet. <a href=\\\"/trips/private-trips/\\\">Ask us for a custom tour</a> and we will plan one for you.</p>\\n    <p class=\\\"footnote\\\">*Prices in GBP or USD could be slightly different at the time of booking based on the current exchange rate. On our booking page you can choose your currency, see the live price in it and pay in the currency you prefer. By signing up to any of our Cycling Holidays (public or custom) you accept our Terms &amp; Conditions. <a href=\\\"/terms-conditions/\\\">View T&amp;C</a></p>\\n  </div>\\n</section></div>\"}, \"elements\": [], \"isInner\": false}], \"isInner\": false}, {\"id\": \"12e66be\", \"elType\": \"container\", \"settings\": {\"content_width\": \"full\", \"css_classes\": \"cc-wrap\", \"padding\": {\"unit\": \"px\", \"top\": \"0\", \"right\": \"0\", \"bottom\": \"0\", \"left\": \"0\", \"isLinked\": true}, \"flex_gap\": {\"unit\": \"px\", \"size\": 0, \"column\": \"0\", \"row\": \"0\"}}, \"elements\": [{\"id\": \"0a170ed\", \"elType\": \"widget\", \"widgetType\": \"html\", \"settings\": {\"html\": \"<div class=\\\"cl cl-page\\\"><section>\\n  <div class=\\\"in\\\">\\n    <div class=\\\"band\\\">\\n      <img src=\\\"https://tours.cigalacycling.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/cigala-tours-custom.webp\\\" alt=\\\"Cigala Cycling Tuscany Gravel tour on the route of the Tuscany Trail\\\" loading=\\\"lazy\\\">\\n      <div class=\\\